flowchart TB
  U[User / Browser] --> API[FastAPI API]
  API --> CC[Code Change Task]
  CC --> R[Retrieval + Context Budget]
  R --> A[DeerFlow Agent Graph]
  A --> LLM[LLM]
  LLM --> T[Typed Tools]
  T --> A
  A --> W[Workspace + Patch + Test]
  W --> REP[Diff / Report]
  U --> MT[Main Thread]
  MT --> AN[Anchor]
  AN --> BT[Child Branch Thread]
  BT --> BC[Branch Context]
  BC --> BR[DeerFlow Run + SSE]
  BR --> U
  BT -. no automatic merge .-> MT
